{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":47,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["关于非利士的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["在法老攻打迦萨之前，耶和华告诉了耶利米先知有关非利士人的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，大水将从北方涨溢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"形成一道泛滥的洪流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淹没大地和地上的一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞噬城邑和其中的居民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们必呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的居民都必哀哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一听见敌军马蹄哒哒、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"战车隆隆、车轮滚滚的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做父亲的就手脚发软，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无力回头照顾儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为毁灭所有非利士人的日子到了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铲除泰尔和西顿剩余帮手的日子到了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华要灭绝迦斐托岛剩余的非利士人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦萨一片凄凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚实基伦沦为废墟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谷中的余民啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要割伤身体到何时呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们大喊，‘耶和华的刀啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你何时才停下来呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你入鞘吧！停下来吧！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华已命令它攻击亚实基伦和沿海一带，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它怎能停下来呢？”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/47.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/48.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/46.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}